    .desc = Fully restore one of your reconditioned patients. Recharges in 300 seconds.
ent-ActionOperativeHiddenPatientKill = Terminate Patient
    .desc = Irreversibly terminate one of your reconditioned patients.
ent-ActionOperativeHiddenReception = Reception
    .desc = Abandon the operative body's senses and remotely assume a puppet's movement, hands, and weapons without ejecting the mind already inside it. Any damage or shove suffered by the original body ends reception.

operative-hidden-popup-invalid = Your internal systems reject this target.
operative-hidden-popup-cooldown = Your internal systems have not finished cycling.
operative-hidden-popup-operating = Procedure stage initiated. Keep the active instrument and maintain contact with the target.
operative-hidden-popup-interrupted = Reconditioning interrupted.
operative-hidden-popup-converted = Reconditioning complete. The patient is now under your control.
operative-hidden-triclor-applied-user = Triclor Hyper entered { $target }'s bloodstream.
operative-hidden-triclor-applied-target = Something black runs through your veins. Your body is rejecting you.
operative-hidden-reception-invalid = The receiver cannot find a viable puppet.
operative-hidden-reception-start = Your senses sink into { $target }. Your original body remains vulnerable.
operative-hidden-reception-patient-controlled = ANOTHER WILL FORCES YOUR BODY TO MOVE. THE HIDDEN OPERATIVE IS RECEIVING YOU.
operative-hidden-reception-return-damage = Pain tears the reception apart and hurls your awareness back into your body.
operative-hidden-reception-return-shove = The impact tears the reception apart and hurls your awareness back into your body.
operative-hidden-reception-return-lost = The puppet's signal disappears. You return to your own body.
reagent-name-operative-hidden-triclor = Triclor Hyper
reagent-desc-operative-hidden-triclor = Hidden Operative legends claim the first ampoule was distilled from the bile of still-warm corpses, blood clotted beneath torn-out nails, and the last vomit of the forgotten theater's patients. One dose turns the stomach inside out in red torrents, tears the throat into screams, and forces the victim to watch hands and eyes rot inside their own mind until the heart accepts that it already belongs to the slaughterhouse.
operative-hidden-popup-tool-cautery = Required instrument: cautery.
operative-hidden-popup-tool-drill = Required instrument: drill.
operative-hidden-popup-tool-scalpel = Required instrument: scalpel.
operative-hidden-popup-tool-retractor = Required instrument: retractor.
operative-hidden-popup-tool-hemostat = Required instrument: hemostat.
operative-hidden-popup-tool-saw = Required instrument: saw.

